  "label": {
    "en": [
      "The postcard features a black-and-white photograph of a snowy village set in a valley surrounded by hills and trees, likely in winter. On the back, there is handwritten text in Swedish, a green Swedish stamp, and printed text including lines for the address and message. The card is titled 'GÅNGVIKEN SKÖNVIK' and credits the photo to K. Larsson, Skönvik."
    ]
